  "what_the_fdts_say": "they are Arm FF-A partition manifests: STMM is 'StandaloneMm Firmware', FLASH is 'Flash Service' (owns the QSPI controller registers, stream id 180), ESPI is 'eSPI Service' (partition id 0x8003, stream id 181).",
  "partition_images": {
    "finding": "the SPKG images are plaintext AArch64, not encrypted: FLASH entropy 5.55 and ESPI 5.62 both begin with `b +0x40` (10 00 00 14), and STMM (3.80) begins with a branch and carries UEFI variable names. Only the 15 AEAD components are encrypted.",
